# NOTE: streamproxy.so / streamproxy-x86_64.so must NOT be listed here —
# electron-builder honors .gitignore when packaging extraFiles, and ignoring
# them silently ships the AppImage WITHOUT the capture shim (share screen
# dies, and ZaloCall runs without the preload the old releases had).
# The shims are compiled by scripts/setup-zcall-bridge.js at build time.
__pycache__/
gst-i386/
*.so